# Inti, Seneschal of the Sun is cast on turn 3. On turn 5 it attacks alone and "whenever you attack" offers the
# optional discard as it resolves; a Mountain pays for it. Two things follow at once: the reflexive "when you do"
# puts a +1/+1 counter on the only attacking creature and gives it trample, and "whenever you discard one or more
# cards" exiles the top card of the library, which Bot1 then casts out of exile in its second main phase.

